{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Demo for Lady Dracula, the upcoming Classicvania (linear vampire platformer) from Goth Donut Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/a1aceb07c390c4893c5226783554b624.poster.avif?t=1758321467\" width=762 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/a1aceb07c390c4893c5226783554b624.webm?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/a1aceb07c390c4893c5226783554b624.mp4?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo showcases two Levels from Lady Dracula:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1: Road to Transylvania (the first Level of Lady Dracula)<br>Level -1: Inverted Road to Transylvania (a Level from later in Lady Dracula)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels in Lady Dracula are comprised of several Stages. The Stages in this demo include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-1: Train<br>1-2: Village<br>1-3: Chapel<br>-1-1: Inverted Train<br>-1-2: Inverted Village<br>-1-3: Inverted Chapel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo also includes two boss fights from Lady Dracula:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Golem<br>Giant Skeleton Biker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The above Stages, Levels and Boss Fights make up approximately 10% of the planned final content for the full release of Lady Dracula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/7cfe4de3174680e9fd02320bb8a4b9c3.poster.avif?t=1758321467\" width=764 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/7cfe4de3174680e9fd02320bb8a4b9c3.webm?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/7cfe4de3174680e9fd02320bb8a4b9c3.mp4?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features showcased in this Demo include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique difficulty options that toggle permadeath, air control and knockback damage<br>An optional CRT filter<br>Customizable controls<br>The player's whip, sword and throwing scythe attacks<br>Transformation mechanics like bat bubbles and wraith form<br>Combat<br>Precision platforming<br>Boss fights<br>Breakable candles and collectibles<br>Climbable stairs and ropes<br>Graphics in the authentic NES palette and screen resolution<br>11 tracks from Lady Dracula's original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/b9f27f71ea61f0e645b9b03da4ffbbab.poster.avif?t=1758321467\" width=762 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/b9f27f71ea61f0e645b9b03da4ffbbab.webm?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044270/extras/b9f27f71ea61f0e645b9b03da4ffbbab.mp4?t=1758321467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lady Dracula is slated for release Q1 of 2026.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044270?t=1758321467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im